OL,3,GNEWSAHoliday hug may have led to fatal
OL,4,Afall - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man fell to his death after going on
OL,7,Fa midnight walk with a woman he met on
OL,8,Fholiday, an inquest has heard.
OL,10,FBen Clark, 41, from Andover, Hampshire,
OL,11,Fand Nicky Foers both fell from a
OL,12,Fclifftop at Cala Agulla in Majorca,
OL,13,FSpain, in June 2025.
OL,15,FFoers told the hearing in Winchester:
OL,16,F"I'm guessing he would have given me a
OL,17,Fhug and that's what made me stumble
OL,18,Fback."
OL,20,FCoroner Jason Pegg concluded that
OL,21,Falcohol contributed to the accidental
OL,22,Fdeath.
